  "notes": [
    "Refined all four Blender survivor models with individual anatomical finger and thumb grips, relaxed free-hand poses, cleaner sleeve weights and detailed physical flashlights.",
    "Walking and running equipment poses now inherit the forearm correctly, scale to each survivor, and use restrained carry motion. Lowered equipment sits outside the thigh; looking up or down aligns the physical barrel, carried light and grip.",
    "Blackwater has an authored first-person flashlight with a wall-clearance retraction. Existing flashlight battery, beam strength and gameplay authority are preserved.",
    "Native checks passed for all four survivor rigs, grounded foot contact, head motion and equipment states. Visual review covered walking, running, stops, crouching, turning, speaking and looking up/down. Four real Relay peers passed motion and gameplay tests in both levels and stayed together across two rounds. The isolated installer handoff verified all 192 game files.",
    "The survivor refinement is a targeted alpha improvement; motion remains somewhat stylized. An additional hiding-camera fixture could not place its observer beside one tight locker; its failed attempts are retained and are not counted as passed coverage.",
    "Blackwater and Briarwake support offline solo or private 2-4 player invite-code co-op. Corn Maze and Stone Labyrinth remain planned. Windows keyboard and mouse alpha; no saved run progress.",
    "Close the game, then choose Update & restart in the launcher. Everyone in a lobby should use the same build. The installer includes the full game and launcher."
  ],
